<div class="hero">
  <div class="badge">Goldendoodle Cost Guide 2025</div>
  <h1>How much does a Goldendoodle <em>really</em> cost?</h1>
  <p>Goldendoodles are America's most popular designer breed — adorable, expensive to buy, and even more expensive to groom. Get the real numbers.</p>
  <div class="hero-stats">
    <div class="hstat"><span class="n">$2,500+</span><span class="l">Average purchase price</span></div>
    <div class="hstat"><span class="n">$5,200</span><span class="l">First year total cost</span></div>
